{"id":231,"slug":"231-currying-la-gi-cho-vi-du-va-truong-hop-dung-thuc-te","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Functions","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Currying là gì? Cho ví dụ và trường hợp dùng thực tế.","question_en":"What is currying? Give an example and a real-world use case.","answer_vi":"Currying là biến hàm nhiều tham số thành **chuỗi hàm mỗi lần nhận một tham số**: `f(a, b, c)` → `f(a)(b)(c)`.\n\n```javascript\n// thường\nconst multiply = (a, b) => a * b\n\n// curried\nconst multiplyC = (a) => (b) => a * b\nconst double = multiplyC(2)\ndouble(5)    // 10\ndouble(8)    // 16\n```\n\nGiá trị thật nằm ở **partial application** — cố định trước vài tham số để tạo hàm chuyên biệt:\n\n```javascript\nconst log = (level) => (module) => (msg) =>\n  console.log(`[${level}][${module}] ${msg}`)\n\nconst errorLog = log('ERROR')\nconst dbError = errorLog('database')\ndbError('mất kết nối')     // [ERROR][database] mất kết nối\n```\n\nVà làm callback gọn hơn trong pipeline:\n\n```javascript\nconst prop = (key) => (obj) => obj[key]\nconst names = users.map(prop('name'))     // thay vì (u) => u.name\n```\n\nHàm curry tổng quát:\n\n```javascript\nconst curry = (fn) => function curried(...args) {\n  return args.length >= fn.length\n    ? fn.apply(this, args)\n    : (...rest) => curried.apply(this, [...args, ...rest])\n}\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** curry dựa vào `fn.length` — hàm có **tham số mặc định hoặc rest** sẽ báo `length` không đúng, khiến hàm curry chờ mãi không đủ tham số.\n\n**Chốt:** đừng curry mọi thứ. Nó đáng dùng khi thật sự có **nhiều biến thể chỉ khác một tham số**; ngoài ra `bind` hoặc một arrow function thường rõ ràng hơn","answer_en":"Currying turns a multi-argument function into a **chain of single-argument functions**: `f(a, b, c)` becomes `f(a)(b)(c)`.\n\n```javascript\n// ordinary\nconst multiply = (a, b) => a * b\n\n// curried\nconst multiplyC = (a) => (b) => a * b\nconst double = multiplyC(2)\ndouble(5)    // 10\ndouble(8)    // 16\n```\n\nThe real value is **partial application** — fixing some arguments up front to build a specialized function:\n\n```javascript\nconst log = (level) => (module) => (msg) =>\n  console.log(`[${level}][${module}] ${msg}`)\n\nconst errorLog = log('ERROR')\nconst dbError = errorLog('database')\ndbError('connection lost')     // [ERROR][database] connection lost\n```\n\nAnd tighter callbacks in pipelines:\n\n```javascript\nconst prop = (key) => (obj) => obj[key]\nconst names = users.map(prop('name'))     // instead of (u) => u.name\n```\n\nA general-purpose curry:\n\n```javascript\nconst curry = (fn) => function curried(...args) {\n  return args.length >= fn.length\n    ? fn.apply(this, args)\n    : (...rest) => curried.apply(this, [...args, ...rest])\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** curry relies on `fn.length` — functions with **default or rest parameters** report the wrong length, so the curried function waits forever for arguments that already arrived.\n\n**Takeaway:** do not curry everything. It pays when you genuinely need **many variants differing by one argument**; otherwise `bind` or a plain arrow is clearer","answer_html_vi":"<p>Currying là biến hàm nhiều tham số thành <strong>chuỗi hàm mỗi lần nhận một tham số</strong>: <code>f(a, b, c)</code> → <code>f(a)(b)(c)</code>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// thường\nconst multiply = (a, b) =&gt; a * b\n\n// curried\nconst multiplyC = (a) =&gt; (b) =&gt; a * b\nconst double = multiplyC(2)\ndouble(5)    // 10\ndouble(8)    // 16\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// thường</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">multiply</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">a, b</span>) =&gt; a * b\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// curried</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">multiplyC</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">a</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">b</span>) =&gt;</span> a * b\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> double = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">multiplyC</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">double</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>)    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 10</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">double</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">8</span>)    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 16</span></code></pre></div><p>Giá trị thật nằm ở <strong>partial application</strong> — cố định trước vài tham số để tạo hàm chuyên biệt:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const log = (level) =&gt; (module) =&gt; (msg) =&gt;\n  console.log(`[${level}][${module}] ${msg}`)\n\nconst errorLog = log('ERROR')\nconst dbError = errorLog('database')\ndbError('mất kết nối')     // [ERROR][database] mất kết nối\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">level</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">module</span></span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">msg</span>) =&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`[<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${level}</span>][<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">module</span>}</span>] <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${msg}</span>`</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> errorLog = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ERROR&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> dbError = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">errorLog</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;database&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">dbError</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;mất kết nối&#x27;</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// [ERROR][database] mất kết nối</span></code></pre></div><p>Và làm callback gọn hơn trong pipeline:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const prop = (key) =&gt; (obj) =&gt; obj[key]\nconst names = users.map(prop('name'))     // thay vì (u) =&gt; u.name\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">prop</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">key</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">obj</span>) =&gt;</span> obj[key]\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> names = users.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">prop</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;name&#x27;</span>))     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// thay vì (u) =&gt; u.name</span></code></pre></div><p>Hàm curry tổng quát:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const curry = (fn) =&gt; function curried(...args) {\n  return args.length &gt;= fn.length\n    ? fn.apply(this, args)\n    : (...rest) =&gt; curried.apply(this, [...args, ...rest])\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">curry</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">fn</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">curried</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">...args</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> args.<span class=\"hljs-property\">length</span> &gt;= fn.<span class=\"hljs-property\">length</span>\n    ? fn.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">apply</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>, args)\n    : <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">...rest</span>) =&gt;</span> curried.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">apply</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>, [...args, ...rest])\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> curry dựa vào <code>fn.length</code> — hàm có <strong>tham số mặc định hoặc rest</strong> sẽ báo <code>length</code> không đúng, khiến hàm curry chờ mãi không đủ tham số.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Chốt:</strong> đừng curry mọi thứ. Nó đáng dùng khi thật sự có <strong>nhiều biến thể chỉ khác một tham số</strong>; ngoài ra <code>bind</code> hoặc một arrow function thường rõ ràng hơn.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Currying turns a multi-argument function into a <strong>chain of single-argument functions</strong>: <code>f(a, b, c)</code> becomes <code>f(a)(b)(c)</code>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// ordinary\nconst multiply = (a, b) =&gt; a * b\n\n// curried\nconst multiplyC = (a) =&gt; (b) =&gt; a * b\nconst double = multiplyC(2)\ndouble(5)    // 10\ndouble(8)    // 16\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ordinary</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">multiply</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">a, b</span>) =&gt; a * b\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// curried</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">multiplyC</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">a</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">b</span>) =&gt;</span> a * b\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> double = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">multiplyC</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">double</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>)    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 10</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">double</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">8</span>)    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 16</span></code></pre></div><p>The real value is <strong>partial application</strong> — fixing some arguments up front to build a specialized function:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const log = (level) =&gt; (module) =&gt; (msg) =&gt;\n  console.log(`[${level}][${module}] ${msg}`)\n\nconst errorLog = log('ERROR')\nconst dbError = errorLog('database')\ndbError('connection lost')     // [ERROR][database] connection lost\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">level</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">module</span></span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">msg</span>) =&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`[<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${level}</span>][<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">module</span>}</span>] <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${msg}</span>`</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> errorLog = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ERROR&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> dbError = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">errorLog</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;database&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">dbError</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;connection lost&#x27;</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// [ERROR][database] connection lost</span></code></pre></div><p>And tighter callbacks in pipelines:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const prop = (key) =&gt; (obj) =&gt; obj[key]\nconst names = users.map(prop('name'))     // instead of (u) =&gt; u.name\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">prop</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">key</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">obj</span>) =&gt;</span> obj[key]\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> names = users.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">prop</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;name&#x27;</span>))     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// instead of (u) =&gt; u.name</span></code></pre></div><p>A general-purpose curry:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const curry = (fn) =&gt; function curried(...args) {\n  return args.length &gt;= fn.length\n    ? fn.apply(this, args)\n    : (...rest) =&gt; curried.apply(this, [...args, ...rest])\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">curry</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">fn</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">curried</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">...args</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> args.<span class=\"hljs-property\">length</span> &gt;= fn.<span class=\"hljs-property\">length</span>\n    ? fn.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">apply</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>, args)\n    : <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">...rest</span>) =&gt;</span> curried.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">apply</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>, [...args, ...rest])\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Note:</strong> curry relies on <code>fn.length</code> — functions with <strong>default or rest parameters</strong> report the wrong length, so the curried function waits forever for arguments that already arrived.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Takeaway:</strong> do not curry everything. It pays when you genuinely need <strong>many variants differing by one argument</strong>; otherwise <code>bind</code> or a plain arrow is clearer.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Currying","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Currying"},{"label":"MDN — Function.prototype.length","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Function/length"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/226-su-khac-biet-giua-function-declaration-function-expression-va-arrow-function-la","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa function declaration, function expression và arrow function là gì?"},{"url":"/q/227-callback-function-la-gi-tai-sao-javascript-dung-callbacks","title":"Callback function là gì? Tại sao JavaScript dùng callbacks?"},{"url":"/q/228-higher-order-function-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"Higher-order function là gì? Cho ví dụ."},{"url":"/q/229-iife-immediately-invoked-function-expression-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"IIFE (Immediately Invoked Function Expression) là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/230-pure-function-la-gi-tai-sao-pure-functions-quan-trong","title":"Pure function là gì? Tại sao pure functions quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/232-memoization-la-gi-cai-dat-memoization-don-gian-nhu-the-nao","title":"Memoization là gì? Cài đặt memoization đơn giản như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/234-rest-parameters-args-la-gi-khac-gi-arguments-object","title":"Rest parameters (...args) là gì? Khác gì arguments object?"},{"url":"/q/235-function-composition-la-gi","title":"Function composition là gì?"}]}